#### Program

```asm
CODE SEGMENT
ASSUME CS:CODE, DS:CODE
ORG 1000H
MOV CL,00H
MOV AX,1234H
MOV BX,1234H
ADD AX,BX
JNC L1
INC CL
L1:MOV SI,1200H
MOV [SI],AX
MOV [SI+2],CL
MOV AH,4CH
INT 21H
CODE ENDS
END
```
